WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.402
There is no universally best shape.

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:06.722
A fixed dashboard matrix may be easier to read in wide form.

00:00:06.722 --> 00:00:13.152
A trend chart usually benefits from long form because the category and time dimensions stay as values.

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:17.572
Choose the shape based on the next analytical or reporting task.

00:00:17.572 --> 00:00:23.682
Long and wide are not labels for good and bad design; they are shapes suited to different tasks.

00:00:23.682 --> 00:00:29.057
Long data is often easier for grouping, plotting, and scalable storage.

00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:34.712
Wide data is often convenient for human-readable reports or some modeling interfaces.

00:00:34.712 --> 00:00:37.396
Choose the shape required by the next step.
